<title>POLAND: Polish wheat, beef prices ease, pork up in June.</title>
<headline>Polish wheat, beef prices ease, pork up in June.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish wheat, cattle and milk procurement prices eased in June from the previous month while pork prices rose, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>POLISH FARM GOODS PRICES		 JUNE	MAY     JUNE 96</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  50.81     51.18     NA</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	    -0.7	 0.0	NA</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		   -21.5     -21.3	NA</p>
<p>RYE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  40.48     40.13     NA</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	     0.9	-1.8	NA</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		     3.2	 2.2	NA</p>
<p>CATTLE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 2.44	2.49     NA</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	    -1.9	-0.7	NA</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		    -3.5	-2.3	NA</p>
<p>PORK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 3.61	3.59     NA</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	     0.5	-0.1	NA</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		    30.7	33.6	NA</p>
<p>MILK</p>
